{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47320","headline":"舟中遇柳伯存归潜山因有此赠 一 · 吴筠","name":"舟中遇柳伯存归潜山因有此赠 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浇风久成俗，真隐不可求。\n何悟非所冀，得君在扁舟。\n目击道已存，一笑遂忘言。\n况观绝交书，兼覩箴隐文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}